# Keep GitHub's Languages bar representative of the TypeScript platform.
# The large HTML files below are generated research reports, design
# exports, and sample outputs — not application source. Marking them
# excludes them from language stats (and collapses them in diffs) without
# removing them from the repo. The real app entry (client/index.html) is
# intentionally left counted.
features/**/*.html      linguist-generated
samples/**/*.html       linguist-generated
keystone-overview.html  linguist-documentation
